  "cleanText": "Solution home \n\t\tBookkeeping\n\t\tBookkeeping Help Guide\n\n### Customising invoice sequence numbers\n\n\t\t\tPrint\n\n\tModified on: Mon, 23 Aug, 2021 at 12:54 PM\n\n\t\tLocation:  Bookkeeping module > Dashboard > Client specific > Settings > General Settings > Customise Sequence\n\nWatch here how to customise / edit your invoice sequence\n\nHelp/Guide \n\nCustomise sequence shows the list of transaction types, example: Sales invoice, Credit note, Quotation.\n\nEnter the prefix for transaction type for ex: Sale invoice (SER). Credit note (CRN)\n\nStart no. starting number for the invoice and save.\n\nPostfix: Postfix means after invoice number you can add.\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tDid you find it helpful?\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tYes\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tNo\n\nSend feedback\tSorry we couldn't be helpful. Help us improve this article with your feedback.",
  "bodyHtml": "\n\t<div class=\"breadcrumb\">\n\t\t<a href=\"/support/solutions\"> Solution home </a>\n\t\t<a href=\"/support/solutions/9000115344\">Bookkeeping</a>\n\t\t<a href=\"/support/solutions/folders/9000185558\">Bookkeeping Help Guide</a>\n\t</div>\n\t<b class=\"page-stamp page-stamp-article\">\n\t\t<b class=\"icon-page-article\"></b>\n\t</b>\n\n\t<h2 class=\"heading\">Customising invoice sequence numbers\n\t \t<a href=\"#\"\n            class=\"solution-print--icon print--remove\"\n \t\t\ttitle=\"Print this Article\"\n \t\t\tarial-role=\"link\"\n \t\t\tarial-label=\"Print this Article\"\n\t\t\tid=\"print-article\"\n \t\t>\n\t\t\t<span class=\"icon-print\"></span>\n\t\t\t<span class=\"text-print\">Print</span>\n \t\t</a>\n\t</h2>\n\t\n\t<p>Modified on: Mon, 23 Aug, 2021 at 12:54 PM</p>\n\t<hr />\n\t\n\n\t<article class=\"article-body\" id=\"article-body\" rel=\"image-enlarge\">\n\t\t<p dir=\"ltr\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">Location:</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">&nbsp; Bookkeeping module &gt; Dashboard &gt; Client specific &gt; Settings &gt; General Settings &gt; Customise Sequence</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><br><a href=\"https://www.useloom.com/share/4134850059c24e03bef32e14ed8297dd\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" target=\"_blank\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">Watch here how to customise / edit your invoice sequence</span></strong></a><br></span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: bold; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;  text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\"><u style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">Help/Guide</u></strong>&nbsp;</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 16px;\">Customise sequence shows the list of transaction types, example: Sales invoice, Credit note, Quotation.</span></p><ul><li dir=\"ltr\"><p dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">Enter the prefix for transaction type for ex: Sale invoice (SER). Credit note (CRN)</span></p></li><li dir=\"ltr\"><p dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">Start no. starting number for the invoice and save.</span></p></li><li dir=\"ltr\"><p dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">Postfix: Postfix means after invoice number you can add.</span></p></li></ul><p><br><br><img src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/9073925496/original/tOdTQsTlUyg87MEPUOeG2XwJ8S7pnmA4xA.png?1553181321\" class=\"fr-fic fr-dii\" data-filelink=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/9073925496/original/tOdTQsTlUyg87MEPUOeG2XwJ8S7pnmA4xA.png?1553181321\" data-fileid=\"9073925496\" data-uniquekey=\"1553181289298\" style=\"width: 1103px;\"></p><p><br></p>\n\t</article>\n\n\t<hr />\t\n\t\t\n\n\t\t<p class=\"article-vote\" id=\"voting-container\" \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-user-id=\"\" \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-article-id=\"9000165202\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-language=\"en\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tDid you find it helpful?<span data-href=\"/support/solutions/articles/9000165202/thumbs_up\" class=\"vote-up a-link\" id=\"article_thumbs_up\" \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-remote=\"true\" data-method=\"put\" data-update=\"#voting-container\" \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-user-id=\"\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-article-id=\"9000165202\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-language=\"en\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-update-with-message=\"Glad we could be helpful. Thanks for the feedback.\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tYe